# Tailnet MagicDNS suffix: zeedonk-ostrich.ts.net
# OpenSSH does not expand shell variables, so HostName is written out in full.
# HostKeyAlias keeps the existing known_hosts entry. CheckHostIP is off because
# 100.x addresses move (creamery_mini already did) and must not be the trust anchor.
# *-remote aliases stay on milc.ddns.net port-forwards as a non-tailnet fallback.

Host milc_group
    HostName milc.ddns.net
    User developer
    Port 22
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
    IdentitiesOnly yes

